        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FJX189DDfgS289pbAnCB-2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Objections&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perceived existence could be an illusion - I could be a brain in a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; jar and wouldn&#39;t tell the difference&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node does not address the means by which we exist - and even in this counterexample, the brain exists in the jar.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#330000&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This is a logical argument, and the mind is susceptible to&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; mistakes. Therefore, we can&#39;t fully trust anything the mind&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; concludes, including our own existence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This concept (and any logic, doubt, or skepticism) is a mental sensation, which requires one to exist and thus invalidates the argument itself. Furthermore, this presupposes both our own existence and the existence of the mind - which also invalidates the argument that they don&#39;t exist.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-50" y="310" width="360" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FJX189DDfgS289pbAnCB-3" style="edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;shape=connector;curved=0;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;elbow=vertical;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;endArrow=classic;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" target="FJX189DDfgS289pbAnCB-4" source="hU9yVLdhYgLbUcQZa_KH-4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="740" y="410" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FJX189DDfgS289pbAnCB-4" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Proofs by Contradiction&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 1px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Any attempt to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;rationally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;prove that one doesn&#39;t exist (formally, &quot;I do not exist&quot;) is fundamentally self-defeating, for it presupposes the existence of an agent performing the attempt - thus one must exist. Furthermore, considering that existence is dependent on the experiential/sensual axioms,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;our non-existence necessarily requires those sensations to not occur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px; padding-right: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;It is fallacious to rationally invalidate the concept of any &quot;sensual experience&quot; (including one&#39;s own existence), as doing so results in contradictory reasoning in which it&#39;s used to disprove itself.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;size=0.043478260869565216;gradientDirection=north;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="325" width="340" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="q161BaAn_xV_oLcZQyov-3" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;believing in your own non-existence is irrational&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;there are concepts thare are objectively true&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;this requires logic to exist&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;logic to model the world is sound&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;information exists&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;axioms and premises&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-30" y="548" width="280" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="q161BaAn_xV_oLcZQyov-8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font&gt;This node does not prove any existence besides one&#39;s own existence&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;The node is premised on the occurance of physical sensations, which can only be experienced for oneself&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;If we can&#39;t experience the sensations that others do, then this node isn&#39;t enough to prove that other &quot;ones&quot; exist&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The only valid way to disprove one&#39;s existence is to prove that sensual/ experiential sensations do not occur&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;However, it is impossible to make a sound argument against one&#39;s own existence, for the very act of disproving requires thought and contemplation - thus requiring one&#39;s existence to perform.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;This node is true so long as these sensations occur (one cannot verify their own existence if they can&#39;t sense, feel, or think anything)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;gradientDirection=north;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="600" width="370" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
